    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A child. Alone. But not without courage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Soly: Brave Little Explorer</strong></i>, you play as <strong>Soly</strong>, a 12-year-old boy lost in a dark and unsettling crypt. With no one to rely on, he must find the strength within himself to face his deepest fears and find a way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A rogue-lite of exploration and emotional survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run throws you into a <strong>procedurally generated crypt</strong>, filled with <strong>creatures born from the child\u2019s imagination</strong>\u00a0strange, sometimes absurd or terrifying enemies like <strong>vampires, zombies, and ghosts</strong>, shaped by his most primal childhood fears. Fight through <strong>auto-shooter combat</strong>, <strong>collect equipment and upgrade it</strong> to fit your playstyle. Before each run, create your <strong>build</strong> by selecting which gear to bring, every combination can change the course of your adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story about fear, courage\u2026 and inner light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just an action game, <i>Soly</i> is a personal journey through darkness. Guided by a small, mysterious robot, Soly must learn to confront his fears, one run at a time. Each exploration lets you <strong>unlock new mechanics</strong> and <strong>progress through an adventure focused on personal growth</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated crypts every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, evolving auto-shooter combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build system: choose your equipment before each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment to collect and upgrade during your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished pixel art and immersive retro atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A child. Alone. But not without courage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Soly: Brave Little Explorer</strong></i>, you play as <strong>Soly</strong>, a 12-year-old boy lost in a dark and unsettling crypt. With no one to rely on, he must find the strength within himself to face his deepest fears and find a way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A rogue-lite of exploration and emotional survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run throws you into a <strong>procedurally generated crypt</strong>, filled with <strong>creatures born from the child\u2019s imagination</strong>\u00a0strange, sometimes absurd or terrifying enemies like <strong>vampires, zombies, and ghosts</strong>, shaped by his most primal childhood fears. Fight through <strong>auto-shooter combat</strong>, <strong>collect equipment and upgrade it</strong> to fit your playstyle. Before each run, create your <strong>build</strong> by selecting which gear to bring, every combination can change the course of your adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story about fear, courage\u2026 and inner light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just an action game, <i>Soly</i> is a personal journey through darkness. Guided by a small, mysterious robot, Soly must learn to confront his fears, one run at a time. Each exploration lets you <strong>unlock new mechanics</strong> and <strong>progress through an adventure focused on personal growth</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated crypts every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, evolving auto-shooter combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build system: choose your equipment before each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment to collect and upgrade during your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished pixel art and immersive retro atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
